  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">f</mi><mo>&#8728;</mo></msubsup><mo>-</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">f</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>iK</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">f</mi></msub><mo>&#183;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">f</mi></msub></math>&nbsp;= Freezing point of the solution.</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mo>=</mo></math>Van &#39;t Hoff factor</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">f</mi></msub></math>&nbsp;= molal freezing point depression constant</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mo>=</mo></math>molality<br />For minimum&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">f</mi></msub></math>,&nbsp;&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi></math> should&nbsp;have the&nbsp;maximum value.</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mtable><mtr><mtd><msub><mi>Al</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mfenced><msub><mi>SO</mi><mn>4</mn></msub></mfenced><mn>3</mn></msub></mtd><mtd><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mn>6</mn></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>12</mn></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mn>6</mn></msub></mtd><mtd><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mi>KI</mi></mtd><mtd><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mi>SO</mi><mn>4</mn></msub></mtd><mtd><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></math></p>"
